      en: ["Founded in 1366 by Duke Nikola Stanjević", "The main church is dedicated to Saint Stephen", "Features Late Byzantine style architecture", "Contains original frescoes from the 14th century", "Served as a cultural hub during the Ottoman era", "Designated as a protected national cultural monument"],
      es: ["Fundado en 1366 por Nikola Stanjević.", "La iglesia principal está dedicada a San Esteban (Hl. Stephan).", "Arquitectura de estilo bizantino tardío.", "Contiene frescos originales del siglo XIV.", "Sirvió como centro cultural durante la era otomana.", "Monumento cultural nacional protegido."],
